# Regenerate:  vhs demo/ask.tape   (from a checkout with an indexed corpus)
Output demo/ask.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 860
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 700ms
Type "bruriah ask 'why did this project avoid FastMCP' --limit 2"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
Type "bruriah ask 'why did this project avoid FastMCP' --read 2"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 8s
Screenshot demo/ask.png
Sleep 3s
